    MC @ serious "Ich habe alles getan, um Ihre Hürden zu überwinden und zu beweisen, dass ich der bin, der ich zu sein behaupte, doch wenn ich so viel Geld ausgeben soll, möchte auch ich etwas Sicherheit."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:815
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_6f3afd9c:

    # ANGHARAD @ talk "{i}*Sigh*{/i} Very well."
    ANGHARAD @ talk "{i}*Seufz*{/i} In Ordnung."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:816
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_f8d06e2a:

    # "Angharad for a moment headed over towards a small chest and produced from it what seemed to be an inscribed amulet, which he tossed towards me."
    "Angharad ging für einen Moment zu einer kleinen Truhe und holte daraus ein graviertes Amulett, das er mir zuwarf."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:817
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_4e8c2d63:

    # "The thing was clunky and heavy, with a small green jewel in the middle and Ramonian written around it followed by 'Angharad XXII"
    "Das Ding war klobig und schwer, mit einem kleinen grünen Juwel in der Mitte und ramonischer Schrift ringsum, gefolgt von 'Angharad XXII"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:818
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_5569b731:

    # ANGHARAD @ talk "My slave number."
    ANGHARAD @ talk "Meine Sklavennummer."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:819
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_8c54c8da:

    # "I stared down at the amulet, and then back at Angharad in disbelief."
    "Ich starrte auf das Amulett hinab und dann ungläubig zurück zu Angharad."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:821
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_7c9b9408:

    # MC @ surprised "{i}You were a slave?{/i}"
    MC @ surprised "{i}Du warst eine Sklavin?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:822
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_ecf760fb:

    # ANGHARAD @ smile "Of course."
    ANGHARAD @ smile "Natürlich."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:823
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_ff164ff8:

    # ANGHARAD @ smile "After proving my value to my master long enough, he came to trust me more and more."
    ANGHARAD @ smile "Nachdem ich meinem Meister lange genug meinen Wert bewiesen hatte, begann er, mir mehr und mehr zu vertrauen."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:824
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_b8b9cf6b:

    # ANGHARAD @ talk "And when his guard was down ... I slit his throat, and took everything he had."
    ANGHARAD @ talk "Und als er unachtsam war ... schnitt ich ihm die Kehle durch und nahm alles, was er hatte."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:827
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_90530c4e:

    # ANGHARAD @ talk "Why should I have?"
    ANGHARAD @ talk "Warum hätte ich das sollen?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:828
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_9c4849c6:

    # MC @ sad "It's just, you must have felt {i}something{/i} for them?"
    MC @ sad "Es ist nur, du musst doch {i}etwas{/i} für sie empfunden haben?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:829
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_64212fe1:

    # ANGHARAD @ talk "... You're an odd slaver, aren't you?"
    ANGHARAD @ talk "... Du bist ein seltsamer Sklavenhalter, nicht wahr?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:830
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_9484688e:

    # ANGHARAD @ talk "No, I did not."
    ANGHARAD @ talk "Nein, das habe ich nicht."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:831
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_6f879915:

    # ANGHARAD @ talk "Had it not been me, someone else would have done the same given the opportunity."
    ANGHARAD @ talk "Wäre ich es nicht gewesen, hätte ein anderer bei der Gelegenheit dasselbe getan."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:832
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_01412b0b:

    # ANGHARAD @ talk "Only people who have always had coin speak of luxuries like {i}righteousness.{/i}"
    ANGHARAD @ talk "Nur Leute, die schon immer Geld hatten, sprechen von Luxus wie {i}Rechtschaffenheit.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:833
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_6e83d0c4:

    # ANGHARAD @ talk "The starving man? The slave? The man with nothing to lose?"
    ANGHARAD @ talk "Der hungernde Mann? Der Sklave? Der Mann, der nichts zu verlieren hat?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:834
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_a1203cd6:

    # ANGHARAD @ talk "He won't question whether something is good or evil when he drags the blade across your throat for just a few coins."
    ANGHARAD @ talk "Er wird nicht fragen, ob etwas gut oder böse ist, wenn er dir für nur ein paar Münzen die Klinge über die Kehle zieht."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:835
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_b800a674:

    # "As I opened my mouth to say something, Captain Nyx suddenly tugged at my arm to intercede."
    "Als ich den Mund öffnete, um etwas zu sagen, zog Captain Nyx plötzlich an meinem Arm, um einzugreifen."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:838
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_4c229a61:

    # ANGHARAD @ smile "Of course you can."
    ANGHARAD @ smile "Natürlich kannst du das."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:839
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_0d17cd35:

    # ANGHARAD @ talk "You and I understand this world was not for us, our kind were never meant to climb the great ladder."
    ANGHARAD @ talk "Du und ich verstehen, dass diese Welt nicht für uns geschaffen war, unsere Art sollte niemals die große Leiter erklimmen."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:840
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_19fd675a:

    # ANGHARAD @ talk "If we want to find happiness, it will come at the expense of everyone else."
    ANGHARAD @ talk "Wenn wir Glück finden wollen, wird es auf Kosten aller anderen gehen."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:841
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_4b0c08c9:

    # "Captain Nyx stepping towards me from behind tugged at my arm."
    "Captain Nyx trat von hinten auf mich zu und zog an meinem Arm."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:845
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_6bdee803:

    # NYX @ talk "Master? Should I fetch us all some wine?"
    NYX @ talk "Herr? Soll ich uns allen etwas Wein holen?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:846
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_becb58c9:

    # "Nyx gripped my arm tightly and I could see from her eyes she was giving me the signal that we had the proof she needed."
    "Nyx hielt meinen Arm fest und ich konnte in ihren Augen sehen, dass sie mir das Signal gab, dass wir den Beweis hatten, den sie brauchte."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:847
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_65299ba2:

    # MC @ talk "Yes, fetch us some wine."
    MC @ talk "Ja, hol uns etwas Wein."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:852
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_d9cece43:

    # "Captain Nyx hurried off to go pour some wine for us."
    "Captain Nyx eilte davon, um uns Wein einzuschenken."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:854
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_a0cc1001:

    # ANGHARAD @ smile "... So, do you love your slave?"
    ANGHARAD @ smile "... Also, liebst du deine Sklavin?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:855
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_edb6a0a6:

    # MC @ surprised "What?"
    MC @ surprised "Was?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:856
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_326a780f:

    # ANGHARAD @ smile "You'd hardly be the first."
    ANGHARAD @ smile "Du wärst kaum der Erste."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:857
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_b4487286:

    # ANGHARAD @ smile "And the way you two look at each other, well, even the blind could see that."
    ANGHARAD @ smile "Und die Art, wie ihr euch beide anseht, nun, das könnte selbst ein Blinder sehen."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:861
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_4ad75aab:

    # "Captain Nyx, after making her way around the room handing each of the guards a cup, she gave Angharad one which he gulped down quickly and threw aside, before finally approaching me with the final cup."
    "Captain Nyx, nachdem sie sich im Raum bewegt und jedem der Wachen einen Becher gereicht hatte, gab sie Angharad einen, den er schnell hinunterstürzte und beiseitewarf, bevor sie schließlich mit dem letzten Becher zu mir kam."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:862
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_6c2d69f9:

    # NYX @ talk "Master~"
    NYX @ talk "Herr~"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:863
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_d2594cc3:

    # "Nyx lightly nodded to signal to me as I took the cup, and with one sniff, I could tell from the potency of the drug she had placed inside of it, that it wouldn't take long to kick in."
    "Nyx nickte leicht, um mir zu signalisieren, als ich den Becher nahm, und mit einem Schnüffeln erkannte ich an der Stärke der Droge, die sie hineingelegt hatte, dass es nicht lange dauern würde, bis sie wirkt."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:864
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_fc146197:

    # "I pretended to sip at my drink to not arouse suspicion before placing it down back onto the tray."
    "Ich tat so, als würde ich an meinem Getränk nippen, um keinen Verdacht zu erregen, bevor ich es wieder auf das Tablett stellte."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:865
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_2a14326b:

    # MC @ talk "Thank you, Lyesha."
    MC @ talk "Danke, Lyesha."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:866
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_ba564e34:

    # "After a few minutes of small talk and laughing amongst the men now they had relaxed in my pressence, Angharad finally interjected,"
    "Nach ein paar Minuten Smalltalk und Gelächter unter den Männern, die sich nun in meiner Gegenwart entspannt hatten, warf Angharad schließlich ein,"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:867
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_f75fda92:

    # ANGHARAD @ smile "Now then, what's say we-"
    ANGHARAD @ smile "Also dann, was haltet ihr davon, wenn wir-"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:868
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_ec8caf4d:

    # "One of the Khazah guards suddenly collapsed onto the floor, the others turned to look in panic, reaching for their blades as one by one they fell to the floor."
    "Einer der Khazah-Wachen brach plötzlich auf dem Boden zusammen, die anderen drehten sich panisch um und griffen nach ihren Klingen, als einer nach dem anderen zu Boden fiel."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:870
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_e29223b1:

    # ANGHARAD @ furious "WHAT THE FUCK IS THIS?!"
    ANGHARAD @ furious "WAS ZUM TEUFEL IST DAS?!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:871
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_fa9046a3:

    # "Captain Nyx pulled out the small stone that she crushed in her hand, and as she did so, it cracked and glowed red."
    "Captain Nyx holte den kleinen Stein hervor, den sie in ihrer Hand zerdrückte, und dabei zerbrach er und glühte rot."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:872
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_284926aa:

    # "Moments later, the place was rushed by dozens of the city's guards, spears pointed and ready."
    "Augenblicke später wurde der Ort von Dutzenden Stadtwachen gestürmt, Speere gezückt und bereit."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:873
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_f35119b7:

    # ANGHARAD @ furious "YOU SON OF A-"
    ANGHARAD @ furious "DU HURENSOHN-"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:874
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_107db710:

    # "Angharad himself tried to reach to grab his blade, gripping the handle as he fumbled and crashed his way into the pieces of furniture deliriously."
    "Angharad selbst versuchte, seine Klinge zu erreichen und zu greifen, packte den Griff, während er im Delirium stolperte und in die Möbelstücke krachte."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:875
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_312c1f1c:

    # ANGHARAD @ furious "I'll ... kill ..."
    ANGHARAD @ furious "Ich werde ... töten ..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:876
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_63273423:

    # "Just as Angharad managed to unsheathe his blade, he too collapsed onto the floor with the others, fast asleep."
    "Gerade als Angharad es schaffte, seine Klinge zu ziehen, brach auch er mit den anderen auf dem Boden zusammen, tief schlafend."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:879
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_3fb94171:

    # NYX @ angry "Seize them all at once!"
    NYX @ angry "Ergreift sie alle auf einmal!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:881
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_5c168990:

    # "The guards quickly swept across the room, gathering up and arresting Angharad and the other khazah bandits while they were unconscious."
    "Die Wachen durchkämmten schnell den Raum, sammelten Angharad und die anderen Khazah-Banditen ein und verhafteten sie, während sie bewusstlos waren."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:884
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_5e955462:

    # "A shaking Alysha approached the two of us, dazed and confused as to what was going on."
    "Eine zitternde Alysha näherte sich uns beiden, benommen und verwirrt über das, was geschah."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:885
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_f75c3c20:

    # ALYSHA @ talk "W-Who are you both?"
    ALYSHA @ talk "W-Wer seid ihr beide?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:886
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_7a2f3bc7:

    # NYX @ talk "I am Captain Nyx of the Novaras city guard."
    NYX @ talk "Ich bin Hauptmann Nyx von der Stadtwache von Novaras."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:888
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_7f402aae:

    # ALYSHA @ shock "C-Captain?"
    ALYSHA @ shock "H-Hauptmann?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:889
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_22d2b2ab:

    # NYX @ laugh "You're free now, Alysha."
    NYX @ laugh "Du bist jetzt frei, Alysha."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:890
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_ed7553a8:

    # ALYSHA @ shock "F-Free?"
    ALYSHA @ shock "F-Frei?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:891
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_57bff934:

    # NYX @ talk "We'll take you in for questioning, and then I'll personally see to it that you're looked after we're done, don't worry."
    NYX @ talk "Wir nehmen Sie zur Befragung mit, und dann werde ich persönlich dafür sorgen, dass Sie versorgt werden, wenn wir fertig sind, keine Sorge."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:892
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_d633fe0e:

    # NYX @ talk "You, and hopefully the other girls too."
    NYX @ talk "Du, und hoffentlich auch die anderen Mädchen."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:893
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_495ac1b0:

    # "Alysha's expression was a strange kind of wistfulness, then the tears began to stream down her cheeks."
    "Alyshas Ausdruck war eine seltsame Art von Wehmut, dann begannen die Tränen über ihre Wangen zu strömen."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:895
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_0a3241f2:

    # ALYSHA @ crying "It's ... It's really over? I'm free?"
    ALYSHA @ crying "Es ist ... Es ist wirklich vorbei? Ich bin frei?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:896
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_32cd786e:

    # ALYSHA @ crying "{i}I'm ... I'm free.{/i}"
    ALYSHA @ crying "{i}Ich bin ... Ich bin frei.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:897
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_18954df7:

    # "Alysha suddenly collapsed to the floor, and a panicked Captain Nyx grabbed her."
    "Alysha brach plötzlich auf dem Boden zusammen, und eine panische Captain Nyx fing sie auf."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:901
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_b328a03f:

    # NYX @ shock "Someone get this girl seen to!"
    NYX @ shock "Jemand soll sich um dieses Mädchen kümmern!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:910
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_10affad2:

    # "A couple guards rushed over to grab and carrying her outside."
    "Ein paar Wachen eilten herbei, um sie zu packen und nach draußen zu tragen."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:911
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_b6310ff8:

    # MC @ talk "Will she be okay?"
    MC @ talk "Wird sie in Ordnung sein?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:913
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_f6a575b0:

    # NYX @ talk "She's probably in shock."
    NYX @ talk "Wahrscheinlich steht sie unter Schock."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:914
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_38bcba33:

    # NYX @ sad "Gods only know what that girl's been through."
    NYX @ sad "Die Götter allein wissen, was dieses Mädchen durchgemacht hat."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:915
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_98d7a4f0:

    # "Captain Nyx shuddered at the thought."
    "Captain Nyx schauderte bei dem Gedanken."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:916
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_97f601ec:

    # NYX @ talk "Anyway, you best clear off before some of the others get here."
    NYX @ talk "Jedenfalls solltest du lieber verschwinden, bevor die anderen hier eintreffen."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:919
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_fbf5b82d:

    # "Neither of us moved for a moment, staring awkwardly at each other as we finally had a moment to process everything that had just happened."
    "Einen Moment lang rührte sich keiner von uns, und wir starrten uns verlegen an, als wir endlich Zeit hatten, alles zu verarbeiten, was gerade passiert war."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:920
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_05a95dae:

    # NYX @ blush "W-What are you are you looking at me like that for?"
    NYX @ blush "W-Was starrst du mich so an?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:921
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_3c65a21b:

    # "I gently reached out to grab Nyx's arm."
    "Ich griff sanft nach Nyx' Arm."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:923
translate de qsttheslavemaster_meeting_last_question_7a392d43:

